+
+**Package name**: `superclaude`
+**Version**: 0.4.0
+**Python**: >=3.10
+**Build system**: hatchling (PEP 517)
+
+**Entry points**:
+- CLI: `superclaude` command
+- Pytest plugin: Auto-loaded as `superclaude`
+
+**Dependencies**:
+- pytest>=7.0.0
+- click>=8.0.0
+- rich>=13.0.0
